# ================= 0.4.0 TreeV3Mig: the player file (v=3 read / write), THE ONE-TIME UPDATE of a 0.3 file, the Dust coin refund, the respec
# History. PROJECT-RULES 4 + spec section 5: a verified History copy first (history/treesv3/<pkey>.properties - no copy = the file waits,
